1
00:00:29,092 --> 00:00:30,718
These damn useless bastards.

2
00:00:31,219 --> 00:00:34,556
This is fucking exhausting.
What was all that money for?

3
00:00:35,932 --> 00:00:38,226
Do I even fucking have a signal here?

4
00:00:51,281 --> 00:00:53,700
This mountain feels fucking off.

5
00:01:17,056 --> 00:01:19,559
Han-su, we need that bastard fast.
He got me good.

6
00:01:19,642 --> 00:01:21,686
That bastard's the fake one! Fuck!

7
00:01:26,274 --> 00:01:28,776
When did he disappear?

8
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:30,904
I saw him falling behind
and panting earlier.

9
00:01:30,987 --> 00:01:33,281
Why? What now?

10
00:01:34,032 --> 00:01:37,410
Apparently, he's the fake one.
We need to find him fast.

11
00:01:37,493 --> 00:01:39,746
I thought he was the real one!

12
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:25,333
MOUSETRAP

13
00:02:25,416 --> 00:02:28,795
What? The fucking cops
smuggled the suspect out?

14
00:02:29,295 --> 00:02:31,422
Those fuckers played me?

15
00:02:31,506 --> 00:02:33,383
If I catch them, they're fucking dead.

16
00:02:33,466 --> 00:02:35,510
Hey, ask HQ for support.

17
00:02:35,593 --> 00:02:36,594
Now!

18
00:03:27,854 --> 00:03:30,773
You won't find your uncle.
This is your last chance.

19
00:03:30,857 --> 00:03:32,859
Let's meet. It's time to end this.

20
00:03:32,942 --> 00:03:33,901
Yes, sir.

21
00:03:34,402 --> 00:03:35,903
I can't hear you. Say that again.

22
00:03:40,742 --> 00:03:42,702
We're following the trail.

23
00:03:42,785 --> 00:03:43,786
What? Who?

24
00:03:44,746 --> 00:03:47,540
Yeah, he came with us.
He said he wanted to help.

25
00:04:07,852 --> 00:04:09,228
Hey, this is it.

26
00:04:12,899 --> 00:04:13,900
Where is that bastard?

27
00:04:13,983 --> 00:04:16,652
About 200 meters up
from the transmission tower.

28
00:04:18,780 --> 00:04:20,656
This is fucking bullshit.

29
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:21,908
Fucking hell.

30
00:04:22,617 --> 00:04:25,036
Let's come back in daylight.
We can't see a thing.

31
00:04:28,081 --> 00:04:28,956
Hey.

32
00:04:29,957 --> 00:04:32,001
If we lose the old man
and this goes south,

33
00:04:32,502 --> 00:04:33,503
I'll lose the money.

34
00:04:33,586 --> 00:04:35,129
You gonna cover it?

35
00:04:36,506 --> 00:04:39,467
Going through all this bullshit
just to take a loss?

36
00:04:40,051 --> 00:04:42,387
We might as well fucking die.

37
00:04:42,470 --> 00:04:44,847
What's the point of even living?
Don't you think?

38
00:04:45,556 --> 00:04:47,600
Fuck. Seriously.

39
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:54,023
Damn it.

40
00:04:59,695 --> 00:05:01,823
My knees. For fuck's sake.

41
00:05:13,835 --> 00:05:14,669
Who is it?

42
00:05:16,504 --> 00:05:17,880
Is it that bastard?

43
00:05:18,548 --> 00:05:20,842
No, just some guy I know.

44
00:05:23,428 --> 00:05:25,471
Just ask that dumbass where he is.

45
00:05:25,555 --> 00:05:28,558
Where the fuck is 200 meters
up from the tower?!

46
00:05:28,641 --> 00:05:30,810
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

47
00:05:39,068 --> 00:05:40,319
Guys, let's hurry up a bit.

48
00:05:40,403 --> 00:05:41,863
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

49
00:07:41,148 --> 00:07:43,234
AT THE TOWER NOW
WHERE'S 200 M UP FROM HERE?

50
00:07:51,450 --> 00:07:52,827
Are you almost here?

51
00:07:54,412 --> 00:07:57,248
We've got a problem here.
Come help me out now.

52
00:08:18,853 --> 00:08:19,812
Hey, be careful!

53
00:08:21,105 --> 00:08:23,316
-Who do we find first?
-Is that even a question?

54
00:08:23,899 --> 00:08:25,359
The perp, obviously.

55
00:08:25,443 --> 00:08:27,111
If we let the suspect slip away,

56
00:08:27,194 --> 00:08:28,446
we'll end up in prison.

57
00:08:29,447 --> 00:08:31,282
Someone's life is at stake here.

58
00:08:31,365 --> 00:08:33,034
Shouldn't we save him first?

59
00:08:33,117 --> 00:08:35,161
Damn it. We don't even know if he's alive.

60
00:08:35,244 --> 00:08:37,580
-Save him? Nah.
-Then the suspect first?

61
00:08:37,663 --> 00:08:39,165
No!

62
00:08:39,874 --> 00:08:41,375
Let's just go down for now, okay?

63
00:08:42,168 --> 00:08:45,796
We can't see a damn thing.
How are we supposed to find anything?

64
00:08:46,547 --> 00:08:47,798
-Sir.
-Yeah?

65
00:08:47,882 --> 00:08:50,676
Let's head down
and come back in the morning

66
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,802
once the sun's up!

67
00:08:53,179 --> 00:08:54,597
-Dong-cheol!
-Are you okay?

68
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,931
Are you okay?

69
00:08:56,015 --> 00:08:56,849
Hey, Dong-cheol…

70
00:08:56,932 --> 00:08:57,850
-What's this?
-Huh?

71
00:09:00,144 --> 00:09:00,978
Hey.

72
00:09:01,062 --> 00:09:02,647
This was dug recently.

73
00:09:02,730 --> 00:09:04,649
Someone tried to bury something.

74
00:09:06,275 --> 00:09:08,235
The old man's alive. Let's find him first.

75
00:09:08,319 --> 00:09:09,320
-Okay?
-Yes, sir.

76
00:09:09,904 --> 00:09:10,863
Grab my hand.

77
00:09:13,741 --> 00:09:14,825
Okay.

78
00:09:15,993 --> 00:09:17,453
What? An abandoned building?

79
00:09:17,953 --> 00:09:20,164
Sir, apparently,
there's something up there.

80
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:26,671
Huh?

81
00:09:28,756 --> 00:09:29,590
Huh?

82
00:09:31,676 --> 00:09:33,469
That's Noja's…

83
00:09:34,095 --> 00:09:36,222
Hey, catch him. Get him!

84
00:09:38,808 --> 00:09:39,642
Come here!

85
00:09:39,725 --> 00:09:40,810
Hey, come here!

86
00:09:41,310 --> 00:09:42,478
Hey, stop right there!

87
00:09:42,561 --> 00:09:44,939
Hey, stop! I said stop!

88
00:09:45,439 --> 00:09:46,899
-Hey!
-Hey!

89
00:09:47,525 --> 00:09:48,776
Hey, just stop already!

90
00:09:49,485 --> 00:09:50,695
I said stop!

91
00:10:07,461 --> 00:10:08,838
Hey!

92
00:10:08,921 --> 00:10:10,297
Stop, damn it! Huh?

93
00:10:10,381 --> 00:10:11,716
Hey, stop right there!

94
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:12,800
Hey, stop!

95
00:10:12,883 --> 00:10:14,719
Hey, I said stop right there!

96
00:10:16,762 --> 00:10:18,180
Stop!

97
00:10:20,766 --> 00:10:22,017
-Hey, I said stop!
-Stop!

98
00:10:22,977 --> 00:10:24,019
Hey!

99
00:10:40,119 --> 00:10:41,245
What the fuck?

100
00:10:43,122 --> 00:10:44,373
Everyone, be careful.

101
00:10:45,374 --> 00:10:46,876
I think there's something here.

102
00:10:48,461 --> 00:10:49,628
Let's go.

103
00:10:54,592 --> 00:10:55,593
Damn it.

104
00:10:55,676 --> 00:10:57,428
Goddamn it.

105
00:11:00,014 --> 00:11:00,890
Hey, Min-ho.

106
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,975
Chang-u, Dong-cheol.

107
00:11:15,571 --> 00:11:16,405
Second floor!

108
00:11:16,489 --> 00:11:17,573
-Second floor!
-Where?

109
00:11:17,656 --> 00:11:18,866
-Second floor!
-Second?

110
00:11:18,949 --> 00:11:20,201
-Second floor!
-Where?

111
00:11:34,507 --> 00:11:35,674
Find anything?

112
00:11:35,758 --> 00:11:36,759
Nothing.

113
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:39,678
Dong-cheol, Chang-u.

114
00:11:39,762 --> 00:11:40,596
Anything?

115
00:11:40,679 --> 00:11:44,016
What do you even expect to be here?
Maybe ghosts.

116
00:11:44,099 --> 00:11:45,935
You sure you checked properly, punk?

117
00:11:47,728 --> 00:11:49,438
There's not a damn thing.

118
00:11:49,939 --> 00:11:52,066
-Damn it.
-What the hell?

119
00:11:54,109 --> 00:11:55,528
It's Sun-yong.

120
00:11:56,570 --> 00:11:57,404
Hello?

121
00:11:58,072 --> 00:12:01,367
Yeah, the pit.

122
00:12:01,450 --> 00:12:02,493
Yeah.

123
00:12:04,203 --> 00:12:05,454
You haven't found him yet?

124
00:12:06,205 --> 00:12:07,373
Where are you right now?

125
00:12:09,333 --> 00:12:10,709
An abandoned building?

126
00:12:11,418 --> 00:12:13,170
Out here in the woods?

127
00:12:16,131 --> 00:12:16,966
Hey.

128
00:12:17,508 --> 00:12:18,509
Hang up.

129
00:12:33,315 --> 00:12:35,943
-What the hell?
-Did you see a guy running by here?

130
00:12:36,026 --> 00:12:37,027
You're not dead?

131
00:12:38,112 --> 00:12:40,865
-I'm still young. As if I'd die.
-Fucking hell.

132
00:12:41,365 --> 00:12:42,408
You just won't die.

133
00:12:42,491 --> 00:12:44,827
If I'm late, Je Moon-jae will die!

134
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:45,786
Hey.

135
00:12:47,121 --> 00:12:49,164
That Je Moon-jae you were always with.

136
00:12:49,248 --> 00:12:50,583
He's the fake one.

137
00:12:51,417 --> 00:12:54,086
That bastard was with us and ran off.

138
00:12:54,587 --> 00:12:57,464
That son of a bitch had us both fooled!

139
00:12:57,548 --> 00:12:58,591
Fuck.

140
00:12:58,674 --> 00:12:59,550
What?

141
00:13:00,593 --> 00:13:02,928
Guess I'll have to kill that bastard too.

142
00:13:03,929 --> 00:13:06,932
Let's not complicate things.
We just need to find the uncle.

143
00:13:07,016 --> 00:13:08,601
He's somewhere on this mountain.

144
00:13:08,684 --> 00:13:10,019
DNA.

145
00:13:10,102 --> 00:13:12,771
Once we do the DNA test, it's all over.

146
00:13:14,690 --> 00:13:18,360
Hey, you do it your way.
I'll do it my way.

147
00:13:19,695 --> 00:13:21,322
That damn…

148
00:13:29,121 --> 00:13:32,416
What the fuck are those bastards doing?

149
00:13:32,499 --> 00:13:34,627
What the fuck is even on this mountain?

150
00:13:34,710 --> 00:13:38,172
That bastard wasn't telling us everything.

151
00:13:38,255 --> 00:13:39,632
Sir, those bastards…

152
00:13:41,091 --> 00:13:43,510
They must be working with the suspect.

153
00:13:43,594 --> 00:13:47,181
Still, the entire Criminal Investigations
Division is in on this shit?

154
00:13:48,140 --> 00:13:49,433
Hey. Get your gear.

155
00:13:49,516 --> 00:13:51,101
-Yes, sir.
-Let them handle it here.

156
00:13:51,727 --> 00:13:53,812
We'll go up first. Stay focused.

157
00:13:53,896 --> 00:13:55,856
If we mess this up,
all our heads will roll.

158
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:57,816
-Got it?
-Got it.

159
00:14:13,123 --> 00:14:16,377
If you get caught now, you're dead,
you fucking dumbass.

160
00:14:23,968 --> 00:14:26,011
How about you two?

161
00:14:26,804 --> 00:14:28,555
Do you trust that guy?

162
00:14:32,142 --> 00:14:34,019
Isn't it about time

163
00:14:34,103 --> 00:14:36,647
you guys went out on your own?

164
00:14:36,730 --> 00:14:39,066
You wanna fucking die?
Watch your fucking mouth.

165
00:14:39,149 --> 00:14:40,567
Hey, fucker,

166
00:14:40,651 --> 00:14:42,778
you think we're suckers like Myeong-su?

167
00:14:42,861 --> 00:14:44,279
You fucking bastard, I'll…

168
00:14:45,197 --> 00:14:47,157
That's not what I meant.

169
00:14:47,241 --> 00:14:50,160
Myeong-su went
straight to the police station.

170
00:14:50,661 --> 00:14:55,124
And once this is over,
he'll use you two to kill me.

171
00:14:56,375 --> 00:14:58,127
Should I get insurance?

172
00:14:58,210 --> 00:15:00,170
That just crossed my mind.

173
00:15:07,011 --> 00:15:09,471
I mean, knowing him,

174
00:15:09,972 --> 00:15:12,182
I don't think
he'll give you any severance.

175
00:15:13,350 --> 00:15:14,184
Right?

176
00:15:15,644 --> 00:15:16,478
Oh,

177
00:15:17,104 --> 00:15:19,606
I'm not saying you guys should betray him.

178
00:15:19,690 --> 00:15:22,151
Just in case things go south…

179
00:15:22,234 --> 00:15:23,485
Insurance, you know.

180
00:15:24,278 --> 00:15:26,697
Insurance that only pays out
after an incident.

181
00:15:33,454 --> 00:15:37,082
I don't care who gets the money.
I just need to stay alive.

182
00:15:38,208 --> 00:15:39,752
Just pretend you didn't hear it.

183
00:15:41,003 --> 00:15:42,463
That bastard texted me.

184
00:15:43,047 --> 00:15:44,798
He wants you alive.

185
00:15:44,882 --> 00:15:47,760
He said you two had
some fucking unfinished business.

186
00:16:00,272 --> 00:16:02,066
Where is he? Where did he go?

187
00:16:03,692 --> 00:16:06,445
Weren't we here to find that old man?

188
00:16:06,945 --> 00:16:08,697
Why are we chasing this guy?

189
00:16:09,198 --> 00:16:13,202
You fucking dumbass.
Why do you think he suddenly showed up?

190
00:16:14,411 --> 00:16:17,873
Didn't you think he'd be trouble
if he found the old man first?

191
00:16:20,042 --> 00:16:20,876
Hey.

192
00:16:23,378 --> 00:16:24,296
Hold on.

193
00:16:32,971 --> 00:16:34,723
Is something up with you two?

194
00:16:35,599 --> 00:16:36,725
What do you…

195
00:16:38,435 --> 00:16:42,272
Then why the fuck
can't you just do as you're told?

196
00:16:44,691 --> 00:16:46,527
Who texted you earlier?

197
00:16:47,903 --> 00:16:49,196
Just some guy you know?

198
00:16:49,279 --> 00:16:51,532
There's some guy you know that I don't?

199
00:16:57,037 --> 00:16:58,664
Where's your brother?

200
00:17:01,125 --> 00:17:02,584
He went on ahead to find him.

201
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:07,881
You fucking bastard.
Then what are you doing? Go after him.

202
00:17:09,049 --> 00:17:09,883
I will.

203
00:17:12,219 --> 00:17:13,220
Fuck.

204
00:17:15,389 --> 00:17:16,932
For fuck's sake. Damn it.

205
00:17:17,432 --> 00:17:18,517
Fuck this.

206
00:17:39,663 --> 00:17:40,956
You fucking bastard!

207
00:17:54,469 --> 00:17:55,846
Fuck!

208
00:18:05,147 --> 00:18:06,064
Hey.

209
00:18:07,357 --> 00:18:08,483
Did you prove

210
00:18:09,318 --> 00:18:10,444
who you are?

211
00:18:28,670 --> 00:18:30,380
When I was in university,

212
00:18:30,881 --> 00:18:32,883
there was this guy named Seo Yu-min.

213
00:18:34,509 --> 00:18:36,345
I've never heard that name before.

214
00:18:41,475 --> 00:18:43,060
There was this guy.

215
00:18:44,478 --> 00:18:46,813
He had everything I didn't.

216
00:18:48,106 --> 00:18:50,025
Every time I saw him, I'd think,

217
00:18:51,735 --> 00:18:53,737
"I wish I were him."

218
00:19:05,958 --> 00:19:07,542
Hey, did you write this?

219
00:19:07,626 --> 00:19:10,587
Yeah. How is it? You think it's good?

220
00:19:11,713 --> 00:19:12,756
It's insane.

221
00:19:13,257 --> 00:19:15,425
You can't just leave it here to rot.

222
00:19:16,218 --> 00:19:18,303
But I'm too lazy.

223
00:19:18,387 --> 00:19:20,555
I still have this much to write,
but I'm stuck.

224
00:19:45,289 --> 00:19:47,499
It was a truly amazing story.

225
00:19:48,333 --> 00:19:51,211
It was so amazing,
I couldn't get it out of my head for days.

226
00:19:52,879 --> 00:19:55,507
But Yu-min was so lazy,
he never bothered writing it.

227
00:19:56,633 --> 00:19:57,676
A few days later,

228
00:19:57,759 --> 00:19:59,928
the club opened submissions
for its anthology.

229
00:20:02,055 --> 00:20:04,683
I think I started writing like crazy
that night.

230
00:20:04,766 --> 00:20:07,102
Trying to remember
as much of it as I could.

231
00:20:43,013 --> 00:20:44,389
Even if I stole it,

232
00:20:44,973 --> 00:20:46,641
it'd be fine if nobody found out.

233
00:20:52,856 --> 00:20:54,191
Just read these. You'll see.

234
00:20:55,901 --> 00:20:57,986
That every novel I've written so far,

235
00:20:58,570 --> 00:20:59,696
I stole from there.

236
00:21:09,081 --> 00:21:11,792
Why are you telling me this?

237
00:21:13,001 --> 00:21:13,877
Huh?

238
00:21:17,464 --> 00:21:19,424
You already know I'm not Je Moon-jae.

239
00:21:23,595 --> 00:21:24,930
Who do you think I am?

240
00:21:37,317 --> 00:21:38,151
This person.

241
00:21:38,235 --> 00:21:40,779
Every novel Je Moon-jae wrote

242
00:21:40,862 --> 00:21:41,863
is mine.

243
00:21:43,323 --> 00:21:44,991
He was a fake from the start.

244
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,964
Publish it as planned.

245
00:21:59,464 --> 00:22:01,007
It'll be a big hit.

246
00:22:01,091 --> 00:22:01,925
THE RAT

247
00:22:02,008 --> 00:22:03,218
It hasn't been edited.

248
00:22:03,301 --> 00:22:04,845
I didn't have time.

249
00:22:06,847 --> 00:22:08,181
It'll be the same anyway.

250
00:22:09,850 --> 00:22:10,851
The ending, at least.

251
00:22:32,789 --> 00:22:33,832
Damn it.

252
00:22:38,587 --> 00:22:39,421
Damn it.

253
00:22:53,727 --> 00:22:54,853
Damn it.

254
00:23:13,079 --> 00:23:13,914
What the…

255
00:23:23,381 --> 00:23:24,633
Did you find him?

256
00:23:24,716 --> 00:23:25,675
-Hey, Sun-yong!
-Sir!

257
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:26,968
Oh man.

258
00:23:27,052 --> 00:23:30,180
Hey, why is it raining
on such a clear, moonlit night?

259
00:23:30,263 --> 00:23:32,432
-See anyone else on your way here?
-Just a pit.

260
00:23:32,516 --> 00:23:33,975
I saw the pit too.

261
00:23:34,059 --> 00:23:35,894
Let's find the old man, our only lead.

262
00:23:35,977 --> 00:23:37,562
There's a trail leading this way.

263
00:23:37,646 --> 00:23:39,314
-But no one's here.
-So…

264
00:23:39,397 --> 00:23:41,983
You said that guy was a fake.
What was that about?

265
00:23:42,067 --> 00:23:44,778
Hey, if he's the fake one,
all our heads will roll.

266
00:23:44,861 --> 00:23:46,780
Not our heads. We'll be behind bars!

267
00:23:46,863 --> 00:23:48,073
-Enough.
-Come on.

268
00:23:48,698 --> 00:23:50,283
Fuck it. I'll take the fall.

269
00:23:50,367 --> 00:23:51,910
I'm the boss here, you punk!

270
00:23:53,286 --> 00:23:55,163
What the hell is Min-ho doing up there?

271
00:23:55,247 --> 00:23:56,081
What?

